{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tribe has been cursed, the only <strong>water</strong> <strong>source has been</strong> <strong>turned into blood</strong>. To solve this dilemma, you must <strong>collect the Mulong cards</strong>, that contain the lost knowledge of your tribe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mulong cards are protected by the <strong>ancient spirits</strong>, colossal entitiies that request melodies from their visitors. If your songs are good enough for them, they will reward you with their protected card</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cards will have secrets, others will have powers you can invoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join this adventure, save your tribe and protect Selve Island with your meodies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/019cb13c2a05ec2a1641605c6419adff.avif?t=1769690110\" width=978 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just another rhythm game, you are basically a <strong>walking 8-note instrument</strong> that you can <strong>customize</strong> and use to perform one of the two Mulong rituals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selve is a <strong>music adventure</strong> where you take on the role of a young member of the Mulong tribe from Selve Island. The people of this tribe have amazing <strong>musical powers</strong> thanks to their connection with the spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play music for the ancient spirits of your tribe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/5fa1da11d4d74cbd26ef8f55b4b7b485.poster.avif?t=1769690110\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/5fa1da11d4d74cbd26ef8f55b4b7b485.webm?t=1769690110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/5fa1da11d4d74cbd26ef8f55b4b7b485.mp4?t=1769690110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The guardians of the Mulong cards ask you for a good tune to convince them to help you. They're very different, so you must adapt your songs to their style, learn what they want, and play it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Summon Mud Creatures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/8687ab87ddde70b9a18acb8a6f7c91c2.poster.avif?t=1769690110\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/8687ab87ddde70b9a18acb8a6f7c91c2.webm?t=1769690110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/8687ab87ddde70b9a18acb8a6f7c91c2.mp4?t=1769690110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take some <i><strong>Mul</strong></i> <strong><i>mud</i></strong> and sing freely to it, the mud will come to life, its abilities will depend on the characteristics of the melody you have played.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play Sacred Melodies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/67314d06474d294c6f691ea749158427.poster.avif?t=1769690110\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/67314d06474d294c6f691ea749158427.webm?t=1769690110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/67314d06474d294c6f691ea749158427.mp4?t=1769690110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mulong have created sacred melodies that do not require the use of <strong><i>Mul mud</i></strong>, but must be played perfectly to  properly work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u00a0Customize your sound</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/d49f0ea6b1af974c43aadbb0efcf3e94.poster.avif?t=1769690110\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/d49f0ea6b1af974c43aadbb0efcf3e94.webm?t=1769690110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/d49f0ea6b1af974c43aadbb0efcf3e94.mp4?t=1769690110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your voice in this game is a very customizable synthesizer, if you change different proportions of your body, your sound will be different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/019cb13c2a05ec2a1641605c6419adff.avif?t=1769690110\" width=978 height=74 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3571850?t=1769690110","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/bf05aec9817cacc09131f7c99b054d38bf84f881/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769690110","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/e07f8abf3cdd1721699ec3a7ffa9b59671533b65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769690110","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/e07f8abf3cdd1721699ec3a7ffa9b59671533b65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769690110","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tribe has been cursed, the only <strong>water</strong> <strong>source has been</strong> <strong>turned into blood</strong>. To solve this dilemma, you must <strong>collect the Mulong cards</strong>, that contain the lost knowledge of your tribe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mulong cards are protected by the <strong>ancient spirits</strong>, colossal entitiies that request melodies from their visitors. If your songs are good enough for them, they will reward you with their protected card</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cards will have secrets, others will have powers you can invoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join this adventure, save your tribe and protect Selve Island with your meodies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/019cb13c2a05ec2a1641605c6419adff.avif?t=1769690110\" width=978 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just another rhythm game, you are basically a <strong>walking 8-note instrument</strong> that you can <strong>customize</strong> and use to perform one of the two Mulong rituals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selve is a <strong>music adventure</strong> where you take on the role of a young member of the Mulong tribe from Selve Island. The people of this tribe have amazing <strong>musical powers</strong> thanks to their connection with the spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play music for the ancient spirits of your tribe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/5fa1da11d4d74cbd26ef8f55b4b7b485.poster.avif?t=1769690110\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/5fa1da11d4d74cbd26ef8f55b4b7b485.webm?t=1769690110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/5fa1da11d4d74cbd26ef8f55b4b7b485.mp4?t=1769690110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The guardians of the Mulong cards ask you for a good tune to convince them to help you. They're very different, so you must adapt your songs to their style, learn what they want, and play it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Summon Mud Creatures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/8687ab87ddde70b9a18acb8a6f7c91c2.poster.avif?t=1769690110\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/8687ab87ddde70b9a18acb8a6f7c91c2.webm?t=1769690110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/8687ab87ddde70b9a18acb8a6f7c91c2.mp4?t=1769690110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take some <i><strong>Mul</strong></i> <strong><i>mud</i></strong> and sing freely to it, the mud will come to life, its abilities will depend on the characteristics of the melody you have played.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play Sacred Melodies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/67314d06474d294c6f691ea749158427.poster.avif?t=1769690110\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/67314d06474d294c6f691ea749158427.webm?t=1769690110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/67314d06474d294c6f691ea749158427.mp4?t=1769690110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mulong have created sacred melodies that do not require the use of <strong><i>Mul mud</i></strong>, but must be played perfectly to  properly work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u00a0Customize your sound</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/d49f0ea6b1af974c43aadbb0efcf3e94.poster.avif?t=1769690110\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/d49f0ea6b1af974c43aadbb0efcf3e94.webm?t=1769690110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/d49f0ea6b1af974c43aadbb0efcf3e94.mp4?t=1769690110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your voice in this game is a very customizable synthesizer, if you change different proportions of your body, your sound will be different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/019cb13c2a05ec2a1641605c6419adff.avif?t=1769690110\" width=978 height=74 /></span></p>","developers":["Nicolas Frois","Distant Point"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/92e2443ced2d481ed87ab2c1290545419b16ea9f/header.jpg?t=1769690110","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3571850/857630003/ee3a952272b61eea2a6069bfee1c14e637c1bcc9/1758284084/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758288680","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3571850/857630003/ee3a952272b61eea2a6069bfee1c14e637c1bcc9/1758284084/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758288680","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3571850/857630003/ee3a952272b61eea2a6069bfee1c14e637c1bcc9/1758284084/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758288680","id":257127026,"name":"Selve - announcement trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257127026/ca3f7ec19b206ea02670d31965c833c5f566d727/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758288680"}],"name":"Selve","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia Gtx 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 G